# 20. Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA)

Automatically scales Pods.

Example:

Current:

```text
3 Pods
```

CPU increases:

```text
CPU > 80%
```

Kubernetes:

```text
5 Pods
```

---

Example:

```bash
kubectl autoscale deployment nginx \
--cpu-percent=70 \
--min=2 \
--max=10
```

---

# 21. Vertical Pod Autoscaler (VPA)

Adjusts Pod resource requests.

Example:

Before:

```text
